5,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need to stop guessing. I want to know what an even split actually costs before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. We need to understand what actually breaks down in these arrangements before we pick a new one.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
